{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_023_mask2former-title\">Mask2Former</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">上一层预测 mask 反向约束下一层 query cross-attention 的迭代集合分割。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Iterative set-prediction segmentation where predicted foreground masks from layer l-1 constrain query cross-attention in layer l.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">二维图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">一组带类别的二值 mask，可统一实例、语义与全景分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Set of class-labeled binary masks unifying semantic, instance, and panoptic segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Cheng_Masked-Attention_Mask_Transformer_for_Universal_Image_Segmentation_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_023_mask2former')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_023_mask2former')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Mask2Former original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/340446d69ea19ad8aa1b.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_023_mask2former\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_023_mask2former')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_023_mask2former\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">单一图像入口，不预设任务专属输出格式。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"单一图像入口，不预设任务专属输出格式。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">单一图像入口，不预设任务专属输出格式。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CNN 或 Swin 产生低至高分辨率特征层。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes multi-scale Backbone to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"多尺度 Backbone\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-scale Backbone\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多尺度 Backbone</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-scale Backbone</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CNN 或 Swin 产生低至高分辨率特征层。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes multi-scale Backbone to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多尺度可变形 attention/FPN 融合并输出逐像素特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Pixel Decoder within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Pixel Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Pixel Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Pixel Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多尺度可变形 attention/FPN 融合并输出逐像素特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Pixel Decoder within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"高分辨率共享特征供所有 query 生成最终 mask。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mask Features within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Mask Features\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask Features\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mask Features</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高分辨率共享特征供所有 query 生成最终 mask。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mask Features within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"固定数量可学习 query 表示潜在区域/实例。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Queries within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"对象 Queries\" data-node-name-en=\"Queries\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">对象 Queries</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Queries</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">固定数量可学习 query 表示潜在区域/实例。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Queries within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每层 query 只关注上一层预测 mask 内的多尺度像素，而非整图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Masked Cross-Attn within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Masked Cross-Attn\" data-node-name-en=\"Masked Cross-Attn\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Masked Cross-Attn</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每层 query 只关注上一层预测 mask 内的多尺度像素，而非整图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Masked Cross-Attn within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"query 间竞争/去重，并更新其语义状态。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Self-Attn + FFN within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Self-Attn + FFN\" data-node-name-en=\"Self-Attn + FFN\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Self-Attn + FFN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">query 间竞争/去重，并更新其语义状态。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Self-Attn + FFN within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 query 输出类别或 no-object 概率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Head within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"类别 Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">类别 Head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 query 输出类别或 no-object 概率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Head within the core query masked attention segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"query mask embedding 与共享 mask features 点积得到像素 logits。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Mask Embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Mask Embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask Embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mask Embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">query mask embedding 与共享 mask features 点积得到像素 logits。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Mask Embedding to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按类别和 query 组合规则得到语义、实例或全景结果。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces set of class-labeled binary masks unifying semantic, instance, and panoptic segmentation via Mask.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"任务 Mask 集\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_023_mask2former', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务 Mask 集</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按类别和 query 组合规则得到语义、实例或全景结果。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces set of class-labeled binary masks unifying semantic, instance, and panoptic segmentation via Mask.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Mask2Former Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 上一层 mask 限定下一层交叉注意力</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Mask-Constrained Cross-Attention Restricted to Predicted Foreground Regions</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Mask2Former：核心公式 · 上一层 mask 限定下一层交叉注意力\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"23\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.561062pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.751101 -69.083544 238.776689 25.561062\" width=\"238.776689pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m023_g7-0\"></path><path d=\"M5.803693-1.956301C5.803693-2.615647 5.448661-3.173555 4.73135-3.173555C4.129969-3.173555 3.550324-2.601156 3.188046-2.166422C2.883733-2.666366 2.296842-3.188046 1.688215-3.188046C.891204-3.188046 .376769-2.420017 .376769-1.68097C.376769-1.021624 .753538-.45647 1.463603-.45647C2.036002-.45647 2.680857-1.043361 2.999662-1.48534C3.340203-.985396 3.861883-.449225 4.506738-.449225C5.30375-.449225 5.803693-1.231745 5.803693-1.956301ZM5.390696-1.623005C5.390696-1.144798 5.151593-.746293 4.629912-.746293C4.086496-.746293 3.593797-1.557795 3.311221-1.956301C3.528587-2.282351 4.108232-2.818523 4.513984-2.818523C5.093628-2.818523 5.390696-2.115703 5.390696-1.623005ZM2.876487-1.688215C2.666366-1.362165 2.07223-.840485 1.673724-.840485C1.094079-.840485 .804257-1.543304 .804257-2.036002C.804257-2.521455 1.050606-2.91996 1.579532-2.91996C2.064984-2.91996 2.666366-2.093967 2.876487-1.688215Z\" id=\"m023_g7-49\"></path><path d=\"M3.506851-.057964V-.420242